1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,647
Reg CF investment limits depend
on whether you are an accredited

2
00:00:03,647 --> 00:00:07,925
investor and, for non-accredited
investors, on annual income and

3
00:00:07,925 --> 00:00:09,008
net worth.

4
00:00:09,008 --> 00:00:14,188
If either measure is below
$124,000, the 12-month limit is the

5
00:00:14,188 --> 00:00:19,008
greater of $2,500 or 5% of the
greater measure.

6
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:24,923
If both are at least $124,000, it is
10% of the greater measure.

7
00:00:24,923 --> 00:00:29,974
Under either formula, the
aggregate cap is $124,000 across

8
00:00:29,974 --> 00:00:33,647
all Reg CF offerings in any rolling
12 months.

9
00:00:33,647 --> 00:00:37,191
For example, with income of
$50,000 and net worth of

10
00:00:37,191 --> 00:00:45,979
$40,000, 5% of the greater figure
is $2,500, so the limit is $2,500.

11
00:00:45,979 --> 00:00:53,866
With income of $150,000 and net
worth of $80,000, 5% of $150,000

12
00:00:53,866 --> 00:00:56,495
is $7,500.

13
00:00:56,495 --> 00:00:59,871
Track commitments across
portals, not one app.

14
00:00:59,871 --> 00:01:03,660
Net-worth rules exclude your
primary residence and treat some

15
00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:05,451
related debt specially.

16
00:01:05,451 --> 00:01:09,240
Accredited investors are not
subject to Reg CF investment

17
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,258
limits.

18
00:01:10,258 --> 00:01:14,201
Verify current rules and how the
intermediary calculates your limit

19
00:01:14,201 --> 00:01:15,672
before investing.

